# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/packed-prefix development window (sticky sessions on the eight-seat 262k packed path;
# scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/packed-prefix and push a tag
# experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is
# pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-packed-prefix-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/packed-prefix commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# A1: the AUDITED attach of the sticky-session twin c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-prefix-gate, the same smoke as A0. Sticky sessions (QWEN_FAST_STICKY_SESSIONS=1 beside QWEN_PREFIX_REUSE=1) make the
# cold path run through the prefix route (the page table fitted to the warmed width, the capture plan), so flag-on cold must equal flag-off cold: design risk 1. READ in this order and stop at the
# first failure: (1) the launched argv shows enable-prefix-caching, enable-chunked-prefill and prefix-caching-hash-algo sha256, no-async-scheduling, and the platform's 'Chunked prefill is not
# supported ... disabling it'; (2) ENGAGED: '[PINDIAG] prefix: install' on TTScheduler with sticky=1 lookahead=16 drop_last=True, and the model graft's '[PINDIAG] prefix: model warm' with a
# restore path; (3) 'packed-any admission passed ... capacity=262144', 'kv reservation installed' with num_gpu_blocks=19968, extent blocks=2, the fused commit and the quads engaged as in A0;
# (4) ZERO audit mismatches and no 'verify t2 kv shared' line (KV_SHARED); (5) every answer's hash, accepted tokens and verify rounds EQUAL A0's; (6) the ledger's free DRAM per chip at eight live
# seats, and the 'dram after registry' line: the registry's checkpoint store is host memory, not DRAM, but the model warm adds a restore path; compare with A0's ledger. A turn without a salt
# never hits or publishes, so this smoke exercises the cold route only: the reuse is A2's. Duration (estimate): 120 min. Stop rule.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-packed-prefix-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-prefix-gate
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code,concurrent8_steady,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
